DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261218
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261219
SUMMARY:Deadline: IKSV Ortaklasa: EU-Turkiye Cultural Partnership Call for 
 Proposals 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Ortaklasa programme\, run by the Istanbul Foundation for Cu
 lture and Arts (IKSV) with Culture Action Europe under EU funding\, suppor
 ts cultural cooperation projects between Turkiye and Europe that rethink c
 ultural policies from the local level up to international cooperation\, su
 pport cultural and artistic production\, and develop fair cooperation. STR
 UCTURE: applications come from a four-institution partnership consisting o
 f a culture-oriented CSO based in Turkiye as lead applicant\, a culture-or
 iented CSO based in an EU member state or candidate country (Albania\, Ice
 land\, Montenegro\, North Macedonia\, Kosovo or Serbia) as partner\, and o
 ne municipality from Turkiye plus one municipality from an EU member state
  or candidate country (the same list plus Bosnia and Herzegovina) as assoc
 iates. FUNDING: total budget EUR 890\,000\; grants cover between 70 and 95
  percent of total eligible costs. TIMELINE: call opened 17 September 2026\
 ; questions accepted until 6 December 2026 via ortaklasa.hibeler@iksv.org\
 ; deadline 18 December 2026\, 17:00 UTC+3\; results 16 March 2027\; indica
 tive project start 1 April 2027. APPLICATION: through the online portal\; 
 see the Guideline for Grant Applications for eligibility details and evalu
 ation criteria.\n\nOrganisation: Istanbul Foundation for Culture and Arts 
 (IKSV) with Culture Action Europe\, funded by the European Commission\nLoc
 ation: Turkiye and EU member states or candidate countries (Albania\, Bosn
 ia and Herzegovina\, Iceland\, Montenegro\, North Macedonia\, Kosovo\, Ser
 bia). Lead applicant must be a culture-oriented CSO based in Turkiye.\nAwa
 rd: EUR 60\,000 to 120\,000 per project (total budget EUR 890\,000)\; gran
 ts cover 70 to 95 percent of eligible costs\, with a minimum 5 percent cas
 h co-financing. Project duration 9 to 12 months.\nDuration: Projects start
  around 1 April 2027 (indicative)\; results announced 16 March 2027.\n\nMo
 re: https://ortaklasa.iksv.org/en/eu-turkiye-cultural-partnership-call/?ut
 m_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://ortaklasa.iksv.org/en/eu-turkiye-cultural-partnership-call/?utm
 _source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Turkiye and EU member states or candidate countries (Albania\, Bos
 nia and Herzegovina\, Iceland\, Montenegro\, North Macedonia\, Kosovo\, Se
 rbia). Lead applicant must be a culture-oriented CSO based in Turkiye.
END:VEVENT
