 ompetitions (Paris)
DESCRIPTION:NewImages Festival\, the Paris festival for XR and immersive cr
 eation\, opens three competitions for its 2027 edition. XR COMPETITION: wo
 rks completed in 2026 or 2027 in VR\, AR\, mixed reality\, narrative video
  games and hybrid performances\; Grand Prize EUR 6\,000\, Impact Award EUR
  3\,000\; fee EUR 75 Early Bird / EUR 100 Last Call (individual talents EU
 R 45 / EUR 60). FULLDOME COMPETITION: native fulldome (360-degree projecti
 on) works completed after 2023\; Dome Award EUR 3\,000\; same fees as the 
 XR Competition. VIRTUAL WORLDS COMPETITION: social VR platforms\, independ
 ent worlds\, multiplayer art spaces and interactive installations in virtu
 al environments\; Virtual Worlds Award EUR 3\,000\; free to enter. No prem
 iere status required for any competition. Selected works receive festival 
 presentation\, two accreditations and industry visibility. Separate Indust
 ry Days calls (XR Development Market with a EUR 1\,000 Best Project Award\
 , Immersive Art Fair\, XR Partners\, Industry Sessions) run on the same da
 tes. DEADLINES: Early Bird 10 December 2026\, Last Call 22 December 2026.\
 n\nOrganisation: NewImages Festival\nLocation: Paris\, France (festival pr
 esentation\; open internationally)\nAward: XR Competition: Grand Prize EUR
  6\,000 and Impact Award EUR 3\,000. Fulldome Competition: Dome Award EUR 
 3\,000. Virtual Worlds Competition: Virtual Worlds Award EUR 3\,000. Submi
 ssion fees for XR and Fulldome: EUR 75 Early Bird / EUR 100 Last Call (EUR
  45 / EUR 60 for individual talents)\; Virtual Worlds Competition is free 
 to enter. Selected works get festival presentation and two accreditations.
 \nDuration: Festival edition 2027\; submissions open 4 September to 22 Dec
 ember 2026 (Early Bird deadline 10 December 2026).\n\nMore: https://www.ne
 wimages.art/calls-for-projects?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
