UID:flemish-kunstendecreet-werkingssubsidies-2028-2032@artificialnouveau.gi
 thub.io
DTSTAMP:20261027T162048Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:Deadline: Flemish Government: Kunstendecreet Werkingssubsidies 2028
 -2032 (five-year structural funding for arts organisations and festivals)
DESCRIPTION:The Flemish Arts Decree (Kunstendecreet) structural funding rou
 nd for 2028-2032 is open. Werkingssubsidies are the backbone funding of th
 e Flemish arts field: five-year operating grants for arts organisations\, 
 including festivals\, production houses\, arts centres\, ensembles and pla
 tforms\, covering continuous operation rather than single projects. WHO: p
 rofessional arts organisations with a non-commercial character\, establish
 ed in Flanders or Brussels and addressing the Flemish community\, active i
 n visual\, audiovisual and photographic arts\, performing arts\, music\, a
 rchitecture and design\, or transdisciplinary and cross-sectoral arts. You
 r operation must fulfil one or more of five functions: development\, produ
 ction\, presentation\, participation and reflection. In this round every o
 rganisation applies for one policy period only\; organisations currently f
 unded for two periods must still submit a new plan. A project subsidy cann
 ot be combined with a werkingssubsidie\, and any running project subsidy m
 ust end by 31 December 2027. WHAT YOU GET: an annual operating grant for f
 ive years\, with at least 50 percent of the grant to be spent on paying st
 aff and artists\; organisations choosing production or presentation functi
 ons need at least 20 percent own income. APPLICATION: via the KIOSK web ap
 plication\, using the official beleidsplan (policy plan) template and cijf
 erbijlage (financial appendix). The assessment handbook (draaiboek) is pub
 lished by 1 November 2026\; Kunstenpunt runs advice sessions and a checkli
 st for first-time applicants. DEADLINE: 1 December 2026.\n\nOrganisation: 
 Flemish Government\, Department of Culture\, Youth and Media (Kunstendecre
 et)\nLocation: Flanders and Brussels\, Belgium. For professional\, non-com
 mercial arts organisations established in Flanders or Brussels whose work 
 addresses the Flemish community.\nAward: Five-year operating grant (werkin
 gssubsidie) for 2028-2032. No fixed range is published\; the amount follow
 s the multi-year budget in your application. For scale\, 2023-2027 managem
 ent agreements set annual grants of at least EUR 1\,181\,503 (Muziekcentru
 m De Bijloke) and EUR 2\,376\,642 (STUK). No application fee.\nDuration: P
 olicy period 1 January 2028 to 31 December 2032 (five years). Flemish Gove
 rnment decision by 30 June 2027\; updated policy plan and budget due 15 Oc
 tober 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.vlaanderen.be/cjm/nl/cultuur/kunsten/subs
 idies-kunsten/werkingssubsidies-kunsten-2028-2032?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.vlaanderen.be/cjm/nl/cultuur/kunsten/subsidies-kunsten/werk
 ingssubsidies-kunsten-2028-2032?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_
 medium=referral
LOCATION:Flanders and Brussels\, Belgium. For professional\, non-commercial
  arts organisations established in Flanders or Brussels whose work address
 es the Flemish community.
END:VEVENT
