 ion in agreement with FOTODOKS. APPLICATION: free\, via the Picter submiss
 ion page\; questions to opencall@fotodoks.de. Results are announced in Mar
 ch 2027. DEADLINE: 20 November 2026.\n\nOrganisation: FOTODOKS\, festival 
 for contemporary documentary photography\nLocation: Munich\, Germany. Open
