 n. No geographic restriction stated.\nAward: Artist fee of EUR 500 (single
  artist)\, EUR 800 (duo) or up to EUR 1\,200 (collective)\, travel up to E
 UR 150 within Germany\, EUR 300 within Europe or EUR 500 from outside Euro
 pe\, accommodation during the 4-day opening week\, and exhibition producti
 on in agreement with FOTODOKS. No entry fee.\nDuration: Group exhibition a
 t the 13th FOTODOKS festival in Munich\, October 2027\, with a 4-day openi
