 January 2027 and results are announced by 5 February 2027. Submission wind
 ow: 20 October 2026\, 08:00 to 20 December 2026\, 23:59 (Paris time).\n\nO
 rganisation: France Culture (Radio France) and LaScam (Societe civile des 
